# Place ffmpeg.exe and ffprobe.exe here before running the build script.
# These binaries are excluded from git (see root .gitignore).
#
# Download from: https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/
#   Recommended build: ffmpeg-release-essentials.zip
#   Extract ffmpeg.exe and ffprobe.exe from the bin/ folder.
#
# The build script (scripts/build_exe.ps1) automatically copies them to
# dist/EncodeLab/ffmpeg/ during the build.
